DroidNux: the Wayland thunk lacked libwayland-client's utilities (wl_list_*, wl_array_*) and
newer functions, so GTK and libdecor failed to load or bind against it.

diff -ru a/ThunkLibs/libwayland-client/Guest.cpp b/ThunkLibs/libwayland-client/Guest.cpp
